<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Vasakronan takes up 5-yr 1.3 bln SKR loan.</title>
<headline>Swedish Vasakronan takes up 5-yr 1.3 bln SKR loan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's state-owned property company Vasakronan said on Wednesday it had taken up a five-year multi-currency revolving credit facility for 1.3 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The loan is to refinance an earlier syndicate loan for one billion crowns which was taken up in 1995, Vasakronan said in a statement.</p>
</text>
